menu "t-sdr-c5 radio"

    config C5_RADIO_STOCK_CAPTURE
        bool "Use the vendor adctrig() capture path"
        default n
        help
            Capture through the stock RF test routine, as ESP-SDR does. It adds
            about 1.7 ms per snapshot. The default register-level engine
            (ported from ESPsoup) produces the same samples without that stall.

endmenu
